{\b What Setup changes on this PC}\par
- Installs the app to Program Files and starts it when users sign in.\par
- "Print to another PC": adds the printer "Nexora Printer LAN" (Windows' own Microsoft Print To PDF driver with a local port). No driver is installed.\par
- "Receive and print on this PC": allows TCP 9102 and UDP 9101 in Windows Firewall for Private networks on the local subnet only.\par
- Removes Nexora Client / Nexora Receiver 1.0.x if present. Settings, pairing codes and job history are kept.\par
